[P_10_Bathhouse_Communications]
Speech_0073L=Lambert: Echelon tracked down Doug Shetland in Tokyo six hours ago. He's mobile and he's wireless, and from what we've managed to decrypt, it looks like he's about to wrap up his business with whoever his Japanese contacts are. From what we've managed to pick out of the air, it looks like he and his men are about to converge on a bath house in the center of the city. We need to find out who Shetland is meeting with and do everything we can to prevent him from closing his deal.


Speech_0074L=Clearly the attack that crippled the Walsh and force-launched the missile from the Battery went through Seoul... but it originated in Japan. Shetland has something to do with it, and my line into the Displace servers shows that he's definitely profiteering on this war. In order to shut down his operation and prevent any further escalation, we need to ID his business partners and make sure they don't leave there with any more of Zherkezhi's weaponized algorithms.
Speech_0075L=Fisher, the bath house where this meeting is going down is going to be a semi-public place. There will be civilians in there, and probably a boat-load of goons. Shetland's men seem to be popping up all around Tokyo in the last hour or so and converging simultaneously on the location. Frances Coen has been in Asia for the last few months, and she has found some ties between the bath house ownership and a Japanese criminal organization known as the Red Nishin... it's possible that they are Shetland's partners.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0002L=Lambert... I-SDF is in the building. Are they making their move?
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0003L=LAMBERT: I haven't been able to contact Otomo... I don't know what's going on...
Speech_0088L=Wait a minute...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0005L=Jesus Lambert... I-SDF isn't here to take Shetland down... they're meeting with him. They're his partners.
Speech_0008L=LAMBERT: My god... Stay there... we need to hear all the details before we can go to the Joint Chiefs with this one...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0009L=Lambert...
Speech_0010L=LAMBERT: Let it go Fisher... we know the truth... we'll pick up the pieces after the dust settles.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0011L=Fisher...
Speech_0012L=Kill Shetland... I know.
POPUPMESSAGE_0129=Eliminate Shetland.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=LAMBERT: Just a reminder Sam... you'll have some civilians in the bath house. Do not... I repeat, do not kill any of them.
Speech_0013L=I'll be careful.
Speech_0014L=LAMBERT: Be more than careful. Be Gandhi...
Speech_0015L=Yes sir.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0113L=Fisher, you have civilians on site. Do not kill any of them.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0016L=LAMBERT: God dammit Fisher...that was a civilian.
Speech_0017L=Sorry.
Speech_0018L=LAMBERT: Control yourself Sam... you're a professional... prove it.
Speech_0019L=It won't happen again.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0114L=Dammit Fisher, you just killed a civilian. Control yourself.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0020L=LAMBERT: Jesus, Fisher... you're getting way too sloppy. I'm canceling all your objectives except your primaries. Complete the mission and get out of there.
Speech_0021L=Yes sir.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0115L=Fisher, that's the second civilian you've killed. I'm aborting all objectives except your primaries. Complete the mission and extract.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0022L=LAMBERT: Fisher, those guys don't look Japanese to me.
Speech_0023L=Yeah... expensive suits cut wide in the shoulders. They're packing for sure.
Speech_0024L=LAMBERT: Exactly. I make them for Displace... trying to keep a low profile.
Speech_0025L=Makes sense. Doug knows how to stay discreet when it's necessary.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0116L=Fisher, the guys in the suits look like Displace mercenaries trying to keep a low profile. Watch yourself.
Note_0092L=The owner's computer is in his office, upstairs from reception.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0026L=LAMBERT: Fisher, in order to figure out who Shetland is meeting with, you'll need to head up into the private offices. Check upstairs, to the north of your position and past reception.
Speech_0027L=On my way.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0117L=Check the private offices on the top floor to figure out who Shetland is meeting with.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0030L=LAMBERT: Fisher, we'll be in better shape if you can figure out who Shetland is meeting and where before you head into the back of the bath house.
Speech_0031L=I'll try and double back.
Speech_0032L=LAMBERT: You should be able to find the information in the owner's office upstairs.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0118L=Fisher, you need to double back and check the owner's computer in the private offices so we can figure out who Shetland is meeting with.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0033L=LAMBERT: I told you already Fisher, we need to access the owner's computer in order to figure out who Shetland's contacts are.
Speech_0034L=You mean I have to go all the way back to the reception?
Speech_0035L=LAMBERT: There's no other way.
Note_0094L= I-SDF is preparing to take Shetland down and compromise the op.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0036L=LAMBERT: Sam... satellite just picked up a squad of I-SDF assault troops moving on the bathhouse. Maybe Red Nishin has sold Shetland out to the authorities.
Speech_0039L=So we can just let I-SDF handle it?
Speech_0040L=LAMBERT: We still need to eavesdrop on Shetland's meeting. Find out what he's up to before the I-SDF tries to take him down.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0041L=LAMBERT: Fisher... those two aren't Displace... they're I-SDF assault troops.
Speech_0042L=What is I-SDF doing here?
Note_0095L= I-SDF is preparing to take Shetland down and compromise the op.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0043L=LAMBERT: Maybe the Red Nishin have sold Shetland out to the I-SDF. Eavesdrop on that meeting and figure out what is going on before I-SDF blows this op.
Speech_0046L=How are we going to stop them?
Speech_0047L=LAMBERT: I'll get on the horn with Admiral Otomo and make sure we're all on the same page.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0119L=Fisher, looks like I-SDF is planning to take Shetland down. Eavesdrop on Shetland's meeting before they make a mess of this.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0121L=I-SDF might be planning a takedown. Eavesdrop on Shetland's meeting first.
Note_0128L= I-SDF is preparing to take Shetland down and compromise the op.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0048L=LAMBERT: I'm not exactly sure... but we still need to find out how the Red Nishin is involved.
Speech_0049L=The owner's computer...
Speech_0050L=LAMBERT: It's the office you just went through.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0120L=Fisher... I-SDF might be planning to black-bag Shetland. Get to the owners computer. We need to figure out who Shetland is meeting with. 
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0122L=I-SDF might be planning a takedown. Access the owner's computer in the next office.
Note_0090L=Shetland has arrived and is about to meet in the Private Baths.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0053L=GRIMSDOTTIR : Got it. Shetland's meeting in the private baths in the back of the bathhouse in a little while... 
Speech_0054L=Who is he meeting?
Speech_0055L=GRIMSDOTTIR: Red Nishin from the looks of it... Coen was right... the bathhouse owner is pretty high-up in the Japanese mob.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0056L=But if the I-SDF is here... 
Speech_0057L=GRIMSDOTTIR: Maybe Shetland's Yakuza buddies are planning to sell him out?
Speech_0058L=I'm going to go spy on Shetland's meeting before I-SDF gets too excited and tries to take him down.
POPUPMESSAGE_0130=Eavesdrop on Shetland's meeting before the I-SDF takes him down.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0123L=Looks like maybe Coen is right, and Shetland is meeting with the Red Nishin, but if I-SDF is planning a takedown, we'll need to eavesdrop on that meeting before they interfere.
POPUPMESSAGE_0131=Eavesdrop on Shetland's meeting before the I-SDF takes him down.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0124L=I-SDF might try to take down Shetland. Eavesdrop on his meeting first.
POPUPMESSAGE_0134=Eavesdrop on Shetland's meeting before the I-SDF takes him down.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0059L=I don't know... that doesn't sound like Shetland's style.
Speech_0060L=GRIMSDOTTIR: Well, unless you find something to the contrary... it looks like a solid lead to me.
Speech_0061L=I'll keep sniffing around.
POPUPMESSAGE_0135=Eavesdrop on Shetland's meeting before the I-SDF takes him down.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0125L=Looks like maybe Coen is right, and Shetland is meeting with the Red Nishin.
POPUPMESSAGE_0136=Eavesdrop on Shetland's meeting before the I-SDF takes him down.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0126L=Shetland might be meeting with Red Nishin. Eavesdrop on the meeting.
POPUPMESSAGE_0137=Eavesdrop on Shetland's meeting before the I-SDF takes him down.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0062L=GRIMSDOTTIR : Good thinking Fisher -looks like Shetland is using Zherkezhi's infinite recursion code to run genetic algorithms that allow him to remotely organize his men.
Speech_0063L=Why?
Speech_0064L=GRIMSDOTTIR: Wow... DoD is gonna love this. Looks like Shetland can establish his objectives and the software will break it down to individual tasks and mail them out to his men.
Speech_0067L=So his people all swarm a target location independently and complete their sub-objectives without ever even knowing what the plan is?
Speech_0068L=GRIMSDOTTIR: Exactly. Kind of a bizarre inverse of Nikoladze's 'glass dagger'...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0127L=Fisher... I found a program on Shetland's laptop that will help us understand how he is managing to keep a scattered army functioning as a whole... it's a bizarre inverse of Nikoladze's 'glass dagger'...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0069L=REDDING: Fisher, I just got a request from Frances Coen.
Speech_0070L=What does she need?
Speech_0071L=REDDING: She's been trying to get a man inside the bath house for a long time to keep tabs on the Red Nishin. She wants to know if you can tap the phone lines in and around the building.
Speech_0072L=For Frances... of course I can.
POPUPMESSAGE_0132=Gain entry to the bath house.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0076L=REDDING: Good work Fisher... that's the first phone line. See if you can tap into the rest.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0078L=REDDING: Way to go Sam... Coen says there's one more phone line she'd like you to tap.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0080L=REDDING: That's the last phone line Fisher... Coen sends her thanks.
Speech_0081L=Tell her it was my pleasure.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0082L=LAMBERT: Fisher, be careful with the alarms, we don't want everyone alert.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0084L=LAMBERT: I'm serious Sam... too many alarms and you'll regret it.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0085L=LAMBERT: Fisher... be careful! One more alarm and these guys will break out the big guns.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0086L=LAMBERT: Dammit, Sam. The whole place is alerted! You're going to have to battle your way through. Complete your primary objectives and get out of there!
Note_0093L=Shetland is planting bombs to cover his escape.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0087L=LAMBERT: My god, Fisher! Shetland has rigged the place to blow. There are bombs hidden in the furnace room. You have to find them all, and fast!
POPUPMESSAGE_0133=Disarm Shetland's bombs.

