[P_10_Bathhouse_EventPlayerNotes]
Note_0002L=Some guys stowed some of their equipment in the massage room.
Note_0010L=There is a medical kit located in the massage room.
Note_0003L=There is a drainage tunnel between the hot dry room and the cold wet room.
Note_0004L=There is a medical kit located in the closet in the restaurant area.
Note_0009L=There is a medical kit located at the entrance of the private showers.
