POPUPMESSAGE_0001=Eliminate Shetland.

[P_10_Bathhouse_InterroBackAlley]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=What are you doing back here?
Speech_0002L=Ah... my god... Uh... we're supposed to check the DSL connections... make sure there's no interference.
Speech_0008L=Why? Is Shetland setting up a network...
Speech_0009L=Yeah... something he calls a shadownet... portable wireless network... operates between standard wi-fi frequencies... almost impossible to tap.
Speech_0010L=Thanks for your help.
Speech_0011L=No problem.
Speech_0003L=Please... I'm just a contractor.
Speech_0005L=I think I'm gonna pee my pants.

[P_10_Bathhouse_InterroFallBack]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Tell me about your fallback defenses...
Speech_0002L=Wha! Who the--
Speech_0003L=Calm down... just tell me what I want to know...
Speech_0004L=I... ugh... okay... the plan is... if something goes wrong... to choke off the back hallway...
Speech_0005L=Why?
Speech_0006L=Shetland has a helicopter circling. It can pick him up on three minutes notice. If we're compromised... we just need to defend the perimeter until he's clear.
Note_0013L=Shetland has a helicopter ready for emergency extraction from the roof.
Speech_0007L=Where will the chopper touch down?
Speech_0008L=On the roof... through the maintenance corridor past the private showers. 
Speech_0009L=I don't know any more.
Speech_0010L=You won't get Shetland... he's too smart.
Speech_0011L=Just let me go.

[P_10_Bathhouse_InterroFrontBuilding]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Shhh... you know what I'm after?
Speech_0007L=Probably Shetland... everyone else seems to be.
Speech_0008L=Where is he?
Speech_0009L=He's meeting someone in the private baths at the back. Not sure who... not exactly sure when... but soon.
Speech_0010L=What's his escape plan if something were to go wrong?
Speech_0011L=I don't know. But I'd bet on helicopter extraction from the roof.
Speech_0004L=Kill me if you want.
Speech_0005L=You're playing a dangerous game my friend.

[P_10_Bathhouse_InterroKitchen]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Quiet... tell me something about the owner.
Speech_0002L=Wh? Uh... the owner?
Speech_0006L=Yeah... I hear rumors that he's Red Nishin.
Speech_0009L=If he is... and I talk... what do you think will happen to me?
Speech_0010L=I don't know... why don't you tell me?
Speech_0011L=He'll kill me if he finds out...
Speech_0012L=So, basically, you're saying he is Red Nishin.
Speech_0013L=I never said anything... please.
Speech_0003L=I would rather die now than watch the Red Nishin murder my family.
Speech_0005L=I don't deserve to die.

[P_10_Bathhouse_InterroLaundry]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0003L=Let's do this the easy way. Give me a small piece of useful intelligence and in return, I won't kill you.
Speech_0004L=That sounds more than fair... what can I tell you? 
Speech_0005L=How many men you have here?
Speech_0006L=Uh... actually... I have no idea... Shetland organized us like a flash mob... we were scattered all around Tokyo... the call came... we all showed up with our own part of the plan...
Speech_0007L=Interesting...
Speech_0008L=I was just supposed to come and secure this basement... I didn't even know there would be others here. Never mind how many.
Speech_0010L=Each of us has his low-level tasking... like 'secure this basement'.
Speech_0011L=There is a shared set of high-level rules, like, 'never fire on another Displace employee.'
Speech_0012L=Low level tasking and high level governance means none of us even needs to know the details of an operation.

[P_10_Bathhouse_InterroLockerRoom]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=What are you doing in here all alone?
Speech_0002L=Jesus... please...
Speech_0003L=What's past the locker rooms?
Speech_0004L=Uh... the corridor... to the right is the public baths... to the left is the pool... but the pool is being repaired...
Speech_0005L=Thanks for the info... but I'm not here for a swim...
Speech_0006L=The baths are well defended... the pool... I don't know if anyone is in there.
Speech_0007L=That's better.
Speech_0010L=Please... I've been afraid of locker rooms since I was a boy.
Speech_0011L=Kill me if you want... but don't whip me with a towel... you could take my eye out.

[P_10_Bathhouse_InterroPrivateBath01]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0004L=What are you doing here?
Speech_0005L=Wha! Who--
Speech_0006L=This place is about to turn into a war zone... how come you're here?
Speech_0007L=I... I didn't know... they told me to leave... but... but I ignored them.
Speech_0008L=Well don't try and leave now...
Speech_0009L=Wh... why not?
Speech_0010L=Here... I'll just make sure you don't go anywhere.
Speech_0011L=No... wait...
Speech_0001L=Please... don't hurt me.
Speech_0002L=I'm a stupid old fool...
Speech_0003L=Please don't kill me.

[P_10_Bathhouse_InterroPrivateBath02]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0004L=What are you doing here?
Speech_0005L=Ha! What are you doing here?
Speech_0006L=Are you stupid... I have a knife to your throat.
Speech_0007L=My skin is impenetrable to steel. I am fearless. I am Red Nishin.
Speech_0008L=What? You're a member of the Red Nishin?
Speech_0009L=No one here would dare harm me... they would see everyone they've ever known slowly torture to death before meeting the same fate.
Speech_0010L=Okay... fine... just tell me one thing... what does Red Nishin mean?
Speech_0011L=Nishin... it's a kind of fish... a small, silvery fish... very tasty when pickled.
Speech_0012L=You mean a herring?
Speech_0013L=Yes... yes... that's it... that's the word... Red Herring.
Speech_0002L=I am fearless and indestructible.
Speech_0003L=I can breathe fire and walk through walls.

[P_10_Bathhouse_InterroPrivateRooms]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=I don't want to hurt you... so tell me something useful.
Speech_0002L=I know lot's of useful things...
Speech_0006L=Fantastic... run down the list.
Speech_0007L=The door code to the Owner's office is 3650.
Note_0015L=The door code to the Owner's office is 3650.
Speech_0008L=Good.
Speech_0009L=There are some guys barricaded in a room next to the Owner's office... there is a vent in the wall that joins the rooms...
Speech_0010L=Very helpful.
Speech_0011L=It is my please to serve you. Please come again.
Speech_0003L=Also... there is a bottle of fine whiskey hidden beside my bed.
Speech_0004L=The camera in the hallway can be disabled from the computer at the front desk.
Note_0016L=There is a camera in the hall outside the owner's office.

[P_10_Bathhouse_InterroPrivateVent]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=You find anything?
Speech_0002L=Wh...wha!
Speech_0003L=Did you find anything?
Speech_0004L=What... you mean in the vents? No.
Note_0013L=There is a vent overlooking the room where Shetland is meeting his partners.
Speech_0005L=So there's no reason to expect anyone is spying on Shetland's meeting.
Speech_0006L=No... I don't think so.
Speech_0007L=Well... I guess I'll have to do it then. Good night.
Speech_0008L=Good night.
Speech_0009L=I'm a nobody.
Speech_0010L=And the stupid insurance application is sitting on my desk!

[P_10_Bathhouse_InterroPublicBath01]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Gotcha.
Speech_0002L=Damn... I knew I'd get caught in here.
Speech_0003L=Tough break pal... tell me something I don't know.
Speech_0004L=Well... our thermal vision kit didn't get distributed yet, so we can't see for crap... but some of the guys that came in with Shetland... I think they're fully equipped.
Note_0014L=Shetland's Elite Guards are equipped with thermal vision.
Speech_0005L=Shetland's personal bodyguards have thermal?
Speech_0006L=I think so. Not that it does much good in steam. Steam isn't fog... like in an abattoir or something... steam is warm... just like human bodies...
Speech_0007L=Good point. Thanks for the explanation.
Speech_0008L=Anytime.
Speech_0009L=I can't hear too good either. Not because of the steam, though...
Speech_0010L=What? Did you say something?

[P_10_Bathhouse_InterroRestaurant]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Cooperate and I won't cripple you.
Speech_0002L=Ah... who... what--
Speech_0003L=Tell me anything you can about the area you're guarding.
Speech_0006L=Uh... the lobby and upper offices are to the north... the baths themselves are to the south...
Note_0014L=The lobby and offices are to the north... the baths are to the south.
Speech_0007L=Wow... you're pretty spineless.
Speech_0008L=A lot of people say I'm too nice... maybe that's why they never let me guard an area alone... 
Speech_0009L=There's also some saki in the kitchen... good stuff.
Speech_0011L=I'm not a very good mercenary.

[P_10_Bathhouse_InterroSpyingRoom]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=What are you guys doing here?
Speech_0002L=How did you get here?
Speech_0003L=I ask... you answer.
Speech_0004L=We... we are here to monitor the meeting with Shetland.
Speech_0005L=Who gave the orders?
Speech_0006L=I am following the orders of a man named Kaneda... but he's someone's pawn. He's not even real military.
Speech_0007L=Kaneda, huh? Thanks. You're gonna take a nap now.
Speech_0009L=I am not afraid to die.
Speech_0010L=I have served with honor.

[P_10_Bathhouse_Laundry]

[P_10_Bathhouse_LaundryAChat]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0002L=Central, this is Seven... I've finished the basement... Yeah... ok... Seven out.

