[P_10_Bathhouse_Meeting]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0003L=It's all clear.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0037L=Yes. This will do just fine.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0039L=I told you. I've taken care of everything. We're secure.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0016L=You have the algorithms?
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0017L=Once I confirm the payment is in the account, I'll get you the algorithms...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0018L=What? You did not bring them? We're not going to follow you across Tokyo--
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0019L=Relax, Kaneda. No need to go anywhere I'll just download them and burn you a disk...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0020L=Ha! You take me for a fool? This bath house is on a public network... you aren't stupid enough to leave that big a footprint on the web... what are you up to?
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0021L=I said relax. You're right... I'm not that stupid. My men just finished setting up a shadownet. Completely secure wireless. Discreet from the web. Now sit... you'll have your algorithms in about four minutes.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0022L=Cool it!
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0025L=You are cheating us! I knew we could not trust an American!
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0028L=Save it Kaneda... I've seen it before. You're defending your honor to cover up your lies. Should I check the account, or should we start shooting and see who walks out of here?
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0029L=Kaneda!
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0032L=Tetsuo!
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0031L=Haha... no... nono... please... we can work it out...

[P_10_Bathhouse_MeetingSecurity]

[P_10_Bathhouse_MeetingSpying]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=How are we doing?
Speech_0002L=Almost done... but I'm reading some low level interference across 802. Trying to pin it down, but it's hard to isolate.
Speech_0005L=You don't think we're in the footprint of a shadownet do you?
Speech_0006L=Red Nishin doesn't have that kind of technology, and Shetland... you don't think...
Speech_0009L=Should we tell Kaneda?
Speech_0010L=Nah... there's no way Shetland had time. Besides... we're in a hurry.

