[P_10_Bathhouse_Objectives]
Objective_0028=Gain entry to the bathhouse.
Objective_0029=Shetland has secured a Tokyo bathhouse to finalize his dealings with his unknown partners. Enter the bathhouse through the drainage system. 
Objective_0035=Discover who Shetland's contact is.
Objective_0036=Access the computer of the bathhouse owner to determine who Shetland's contact is and where and when they will be meeting.
Objective_0003=Tap the bathhouse telephone lines.
Objective_0020=Third Echelon Field Runner Frances Coen has been monitoring the activities of a Yakuza organization known as the Red Nishin. Tap the bathhouse phone lines for her.
Objective_0018=Find out who gave the I-SDF assault team their orders.
Objective_0021=The inbound I-SDF assault team is being coordinated locally. Determine who is commanding them.
