Speech_0001L=Zachari!
Speech_0002L=Yes sir?
Speech_0003L=I just double checked the blueprints. Turns out there is a vent that comes out in the meeting room. I-SDF makes me nervous. Make sure the vent is clear of any surveillance gear.
Speech_0004L=Yes sir.
Speech_0005L=Be quick about it. The meeting will start soon.
Speech_0006L=I'm on it.

