[P_10_Bathhouse_PublicBathsChat01]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Whoa! You scared me there for a second.
Speech_0002L=Sorry.
Speech_0003L=Visibility in here is terrible. If something goes down... be next to impossible to fight.
Speech_0004L=Got any night vision gear?
Speech_0005L=Night vision doesn't help in this crap. Maybe if we had thermal.
Speech_0006L=Guess we'll just have to rely on our ears.
Speech_0007L=Yeah... unfortunately since Mogadishu I don't hear so good.
Speech_0008L=You were with the Rangers in Mogadishu?
Speech_0009L=Uh... no... I was, uh... kind of working for General Aidid... but only indirectly. 
Speech_0010L=Oh... forget I asked. 

