[P_10_Bathhouse_RadioTVBroadcast]
Speech_0001L=Long Dan, the Chinese ambassador to the US, has been praised for his diplomatic effort in bringing about a cease-fire in the Korean War. Even as American and North and South Korean forces face an uneasy stand-off in still-occupied Seoul, diplomats return to the bargaining table for an emergency session.
Speech_0002L=In other news, 141 of the bodies recovered from the Walsh incident arrived in the United States today in preparation for funeral services due to commence the day after tomorrow. The USS Walsh is now confirmed lost with all hands, leaving the death toll at a staggering 283 crewman and officers.

[P_10_Bathhouse_Reception]

[P_10_Bathhouse_ReceptionChat01]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Is the upstairs secure?
Speech_0002L=Yeah. Might be some Red Nishin guys up in the private rooms, but I didn't disturb them. How about the front?
Speech_0003L=It's tight. A truck is blocking the alley and I sent the guys unloading it for a coffee break...
Speech_0004L=Which guys?
Speech_0005L=Just some guys... worker guys...
Speech_0006L=What? You just said 'hey, why don't you guys take a break?' and they did?
Speech_0007L=Well, I gave them a hundred thousand Yen.
Speech_0008L=Oh... okay. Well don't forget to expense that.
Speech_0009L=Yeah... no kidding.

