Speech_0008L=Whatever... close enough

[P_10_Bathhouse_ShetlandFight]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0005L=This pointless Sam... you won't know what to do if you catch me. Why bother chasing?
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0003L=Mason and Lambert have you wrapped around their fingers, Fisher... you're no more to them than any other weapon.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0004L=You've made yourself the instrument of a policy you don't believe in Sam... walk away.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0002L=Blood is thicker than water, and you and I have bled a lot together. You're trading your honor for their agenda.

