[P_10_Bathhouse_TechnicianRepair]

[P_10_Bathhouse_TextLocalization]
Speech_0002L=Did you hear? NASA gave up on all their posturing crap and gave China the go ahead.
Speech_0003L=Really?
Speech_0004L=Yeah... I guess that some big-wig at NASA finally swallowed his pride and asked the President to tell NORAD not to shoot the Chinese capsule down.
Speech_0005L=Wow.
Speech_0006L=Yeah. Looks like they're going to go for it sometime in the next twelve hours.
Speech_0007L=How many guys did China send up?
Speech_0008L=Just one. Their capsule only holds three. If they want to rescue the two guys they could only send the pilot.
Speech_0009L=Is it dangerous?
Speech_0010L=I think it might honestly be the single most dangerous thing that any human being has ever attempted.
Speech_0011L=Cool. Go Taikonauts!
Speech_0012L=I hear these Red Nishin are Yakuza... they run this place.
Speech_0013L=Yakuza? Man... that is so eighties...
Speech_0014L=Hey... these guys are serious... they got ninja's and stuff.
Speech_0015L=What's with the ninja's again? Man... it's like a virus in this company... everyone's talking about ninjas...
Speech_0016L=You should take it more seriously. I heard it was a ninja that killed Milan Nedich.
Speech_0017L=Whatever. Look, when you start hearing about zombie ninja's, come tell me... until then, I'll trust my assault rifle to protect me from any yakuza ninjas with their little swords and caltrops.
Speech_0018L=Guns won't protect against ninja's. They're bulletproof.
Speech_0019L=Leave me alone geek.
Speech_0020L=Hey... what are you doing here?
Speech_0021L=What am I doing here? What are we all doing here?
Speech_0022L=You know what... I think Shetland organized us like a flash mob.
Speech_0023L=What's a flash mob?
Speech_0024L=It's like when you use the internet to tell a whole bunch of people to show up at the same place at the same time, but no one knows who else is going to be there. 
Speech_0025L=Cool. But why would he do that?
Speech_0026L=OPSEC. If no one knows the whole plan... hell... if no one even knows there is a 'whole plan' then the plan can't be compromised.
Speech_0027L=So each guys shows up in response to his own individual orders, completes his mission, and leaves.
Speech_0028L=Exactly. Emergent strategic planning.
Speech_0029L=It doesn't have to end like this, Sam.
Speech_0030L=No... but it does have to end.
Speech_0031L=On that we agree. We've been fighting their dirty little wars our entire lives, and where do we end up? Staring at each other down the barrels of our guns... nothing has changed Fisher, and it won't change by degrees. We have to tear it down and start over... it's the only way.
Speech_0032L=Your own little chaos theory? Throw the world into war and hope that what comes out the other side is better?
Speech_0033L=It will be better. Because this war will change things, Sam. Every other war has been about keeping things the same, but the status quo doesn't work anymore. America is sick Sam... she's dying. The politicians, the bureaucrats, the whispered back room deals... it's all life support for a sick old lady who was dead a long time ago.
Speech_0034L=The only back room deals that I've seen lately were made by you. You're a murderer and a war criminal.
Speech_0035L=Those are the only names the state has for the revolutionary, Sam. You only become a hero after the war is over. You know the truth... the world is built from the bottom up... not the other way around. Honor. Courage. Fidelity. We don't inherit these things from the world, Sam. We build the world from them. I know you... you believe in these things more than any government... and I know that because of it... you wouldn't shoot an old friend.
Speech_0053L=This pointless Sam... you won't know what to do if you catch me. Why bother chasing?
Note_0036L=There is a medical kit located in the washroom in the Private Baths.
Note_0037L=There is a medical kit located in the closet in the restaurant area.
Note_0038L=Some guys stowed some of their equipment in the massage room.
Note_0039L=Supplies can be found at the entrance of the private showers.
Note_0040L=An I-SDF monitoring team across the street may have some supplies.
Note_0041L=The door code to the Owner's office is 3650.
Note_0042L=The owners computer is in his office, upstairs from reception.
Note_0043L=There is a camera in the hall outside the owners office.
Note_0044L=There is a vent overlooking the room where Shetland is meeting his partners.
Note_0045L=There is a drainage tunnel between the hot dry room and the cold wet room.
Note_0046L=Shetland has arrived and is about to meet in the Private Baths.
Note_0047L=Shetland's Elite Guards are equipped with thermal vision.
Note_0048L=Shetland has a helicopter ready for emergency extraction from the roof.
Note_0049L=Shetland is planting bombs to cover his escape.
Note_0050L=Shetland may be meeting with the Red Nishin, a Yakuza organization.
Note_0051L=The lobby and offices are to the north... the baths are to the south.
Note_0052L= I-SDF is preparing to take Shetland down and compromise the op.
